Subject: [PATCH 1/1] ACPI / PCI: Fix "Operation not permitted" error reading sysfs acpi_index and label files.
Date: Wed, 18 Jun 2014 16:55:30 +0200
Message-Id: <1403103330-17874-1-git-send-email-simone.gotti@gmail.com>
In-Reply-To: <1403103077-17589-1-git-send-email-simone.gotti@gmail.com>
